  "content": "\n\n<h5><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jm3PCWv.png\" alt=\"\"></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 全面重做的世界生成（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 完全优化，支持着色器</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 自定义<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.horizon.pics%252f39d7ccdc-f694-466a-832b-027a84051a8f%253fa%253d580%2526mime1%253dimage%2526mime2%253dpng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">着色器预设</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 重做的要塞与 Fortresses</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 数百个全新地牢与建筑（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-voyager-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moog's Voyager Structures</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorabuild-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdoraBuild: Structures</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/formations-overworld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Formations</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 新首领与生物（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs-1-21-1-port\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends &amp; Foes</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 生活质量特性，例如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">传送石</a>与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-tome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">经验书</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 包含 1.21.2+ 的内容（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillabackport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Backport</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a> 附带<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeroplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">额外功能</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">可骑乘的龙</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 众多自定义特性，提升体验</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 内置的<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tLTC6wYcWVM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">免费世界共享</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f29331%252fbetter-mc-neoforge-bmc5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">320 余个模组</a></strong></h5>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LfhUwM-LkZ8\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a9SYvVghFlA\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>非官方我的世界产品。未经 Mojang 或微软批准或与其关联。</strong></span></p>",
